WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.438
Let’s walk through Macro PLI.

00:00:02.438 --> 00:00:05.450
Trace the finalized chain from source action through lever,

00:00:05.450 --> 00:00:09.400
instrument, implementation assessment, modifiers, citations, and

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:10.438
outputs.

00:00:10.438 --> 00:00:13.375
White Cell consumes this evidence but does not impersonate the

00:00:13.375 --> 00:00:15.850
specialist who approved or overrode it.

00:00:15.850 --> 00:00:19.250
On this slide, monitor finalized Macro specialist outputs in

00:00:19.250 --> 00:00:20.613
read-only form.

00:00:20.613 --> 00:00:24.450
In practice, the specialist seat owns approval or override

00:00:24.450 --> 00:00:24.613
.

00:00:24.613 --> 00:00:28.262
White Cell consumes finalized evidence and must not impersonate the

00:00:28.262 --> 00:00:29.712
SME decision.

00:00:30.210 --> 00:00:33.485
When you are ready, use Open Macro PLI to

00:00:33.485 --> 00:00:35.235
move to the live surface.

00:00:35.235 --> 00:00:37.910
The guide will not make the workflow decision for you

00:00:37.910 --> 00:00:38.060
.
